                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d32758a-7f3a-43ba-b787-e25a92a9f71b",
                                                "sense_id": "f0cc6716-408f-32cf-9d03-5067921c2a75",
                                                "text": "Col. Cresop, the last spring, in cold blood, and unprovoked, murdered all the relations of Logan, not sparing even my women and children. - - - Logan never felt fear. He will not turn on his heel to save his life. Who is there to mourn for Logan? No one."
                                            },
