                                                "example_id": "0dee370a-0144-4eab-9743-cb0dd209fb71",
                                                "sense_id": "f0cc6716-408f-32cf-9d03-5067921c2a75",
                                                "text": "\"How about Logan?\"\n\"That's it. The perfect name!\" I exclaimed. Starla liked the name, and I thought it was exceedingly cool because one of the most exciting characters in the X-Men comics is also named Logan (nicknamed Wolverine). - - - I didn't tell Starla about the comic book connection because she would probably think I was being stupid."
                                            }
